1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,150
This is wikipedia dot org, the doorway to the free encyclopedia in hundreds of languages.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:08,101
Behind those articles sits a shared store of facts.

3
00:00:08,101 --> 00:00:11,689
At the bottom of the portal, the Wikidata link takes us there.

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:18,193
Wikidata is the free knowledge base that anyone can edit, with more than a hundred and twenty million data entities.

5
00:00:18,193 --> 00:00:24,014
Both people and machines can read it, and it feeds structured data to Wikipedia and its sister projects.

6
00:00:24,014 --> 00:00:26,967
Under Related to current events, let's open one item.

7
00:00:26,967 --> 00:00:29,062
Every item has its own Q number.

8
00:00:29,062 --> 00:00:32,468
This one is Hexed, an upcoming Disney animated film.

9
00:00:32,468 --> 00:00:42,880
Its facts are written as statements: it is an animated film, released on the twenty-fifth of November, 2026, and directed by Fawn Veerasunthorn and Jason Hand.

10
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:48,700
Further down, identifiers link it to IMDb, Rotten Tomatoes and dozens of other databases.
